---
project: airgenome
purpose: harvest + label + forecast pipeline (gate-cycle SSOT) + supervisor + transcript-watcher hook bus. raw 0 root-ssot triad — companion to .raw-ref (hive canonical pin) and .own (project-local L1 rules).
language: hexa (raw#9 hexa-only — native bin/airgenome single entry-point + bin/airgenome-init native bootstrap)
package-manager: hexa wrapper / launchd LaunchAgent
canonical-files: .raw-ref .own .guide .roadmap .convergence .hook-advice.md
ssot-anchors:
  - .raw-ref (hive canonical L0 pin — github.com/need-singularity/hive .raw)
  - .own (project-local L1 rules — 4 rules bootstrapped 2026-04-28; mirror anima own 7/8/9/10)
  - .roadmap (hybrid main + cell/lora sub track SSOT, M0-M25 milestones — config/roadmap/airgenome.json)
  - .convergence (수렴 attr 기록 — single-file entry tracking, no JSON/JSONL/xattr)
  - modules/ (gate-cycle: harvest.hexa + forecast.hexa + label.hexa + dispatch.hexa + genome_merge.hexa + probe.hexa + predictive_throttle.hexa)
  - hooks/ (hook_main.hexa transcript-watcher native binary + LaunchAgent plist)
  - bin/airgenome (single entry-point CLI per workspace member exports)
  - state/ (rig_trend_history.jsonl + discovery_absorption/registry.jsonl — gate-cycle witness ledgers)
honesty-triad:
  preconditions:
    - "(a) git tracked SSOT"
    - "(b) gate-cycle 3-stage modules present (harvest/forecast/label)"
    - "(c) bin/airgenome single entry-point"
    - "(d) .raw-ref hive canonical pin"
    - "(e) .own project-local L1 rules — bootstrapped 2026-04-28"
gate-cycle:
  description: capture (harvest) → forecast → label triad — airgenome canonical pipeline. raw 156 placement-axis canonical example (each stage = different placement frame).
  modules:
    - capture: modules/harvest.hexa (rig_trend_history append, e2e sample emit, discovery_absorption registry)
    - forecast: modules/forecast.hexa (predictive throttle decision, forecast manifest)
    - label: modules/label.hexa (classification output, multi-class window)
  invariants:
    - "own 1 (heredoc-arg-max-guard): gate-cycle dynamic-content emit > 4 KiB MUST use native write_file()"
    - "own 2 (content-class topology): each stage artifact MUST declare content-class (structured-ledger/structured-event/mixed/text-heavy)"
    - "own 3 (try-revert-orthogonality): every transform-applying dispatch MUST wrap try-and-revert + role-tag (primary-attack/secondary-stacking)"
    - "own 4 (placement-axis): every algorithm catalog dispatch MUST declare @placement(axis) + @stage(capture/forecast/label) — capture-pre-vs-post / forecast-pre-vs-post / label-pre-vs-post measurement before promotion"
workspace-membership:
  declared-in: ~/core/.workspace line 136-140
  role: both
  exports: airgenome.hooks (hooks/airgenome_hooks.json), airgenome.cli (bin/airgenome)
  imports: nx@nexus, infra.state@nexus
  commands: ag-hooks, ag-status (subcommands of bin/airgenome)
notes:
  - "2026-04-28 bootstrap: airgenome /.own + /.guide added; a356c461 sister-repo /.own mirror count corrected 60% (3/5) → 80% (4/5). hexa-lang REJECTED for parser-self-host scope (intentional)."
  - "gate-cycle = raw 156 forward-spec canonical example; capture stage measurement (rig_trend_history A1+A8 67%) anchors empirical placement-axis evidence."
